stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: draft / action created
  pending --> pending: edit (reviewer re-checks, may refuse)
  pending --> approved: human approves<br/>(blocked if reviewer flagged)
  pending --> rejected: human rejects
  pending --> superseded: weekly loop re-run (actions only)
  approved --> written: call_tool runs exactly this action's writes
  rejected --> [*]: nothing written
  written --> [*]
  note right of approved
    approving one action never approves another;
    each action owns its own ApprovalGate
  end note
